title: The Binding Ritual
portrait left: seeker
portrait right: archivist

archivist: A page you no longer need. Give it to the binding, and it is gone. The binding takes a little of you in return.

choice:
  - Remove a card, take 8 damage -> one
  - [if hp > 20] Remove two cards, take 16 damage -> two
  - Leave -> leave

@one
  > hp -8
  > card remove choose 1
  archivist: Lighter already.
  > end

@two
  > hp -16
  > card remove choose 2
  archivist: Lighter. Paler. Off you go.
  > end

@leave
  archivist: Some people like their weight.
  > end
